Author: <a href="https://www.smspower.org:443/forums/profile.php?mode=viewprofile&u=17603" target="_blank">bofner</a><br />

Posted: Fri Nov 06, 2026 12:03 pm (GMT 0)<br />
<br /><blockquote>  <div class="attribution">sverx wrote    <script type="text/javascript" src="./templates/select_expand_bbcodes.js"></script>    <script type="text/javascript">    
<!--
        var id = 'SXBB' + (1000 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 5000));        SXBB[id] = new _SXBB(id);        SXBB[id].T['select'] = 'Select';        SXBB[id].T['expand'] = '[+]';        SXBB[id].T['contract'] = '[-]';        SXBB[id].writeCmd();    
//-->
    </script>  </div>  <div class="body">    <script type="text/javascript">      
<!--
        SXBB[id].writeDiv();      
//-->
    </script>Interesting exporter!
<br />
I think it would also be very nice to be able to export the same data in binary format, so that it could also be used with other tools apart from assemblers (and many assemblers can use binary files too anyway).    <script type="text/javascript">      
<!--
        document.write('</div>');      
//-->
    </script>  </div></blockquote>
<br />

<br />
Only took me most the year to get around to it, but I added BIN export support! I only did a quick check to make sure it was working, but all of the BIN outputs and the INC outputs look to be the same!<br />

